Share those details and a one-paragraph synopsis, and we can start narrowing the search. You can also paste the opening pages for feedback. One practical tip: leave “better than Tolstoy” out of the query letter—a compelling premise and strong writing will make a more persuasive case.89:T4e1,Yes—I can help you find suitable agents or publishers and prepare a submission. Finishing a novel is a milestone. I haven’t read yours, so I can’t judge the Tolstoy comparison—but we can assess it on its own merits.

